  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package angel hair pasta",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "2 pounds sea scallops, rinsed and patted dry",
    "3 tablespoons chopped fresh basil",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh flat-leaf parsley",
    "2 tablespoons fresh lemon juice",
    "salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.5 cup heavy cream",
    "1 tablespoon grated Parmesan cheese to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add angel hair pasta and cook, uncovered, for 4 to 5 minutes or until al dente; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SgM7omf5Q-SYGjH3itHOGOS_XvI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216757-savory-sea-scallops-and-angel-hair-pasta-ddmfs-step-1-0376-3x4-d6b9e0ea143e42f99d6bb7552c52d6e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216757/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While pasta is cooking, melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Stir in garlic and cook just until fragrant and softened, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p11IhPp8zctLfAbbw_gb364JWUM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216757-savory-sea-scallops-and-angel-hair-pasta-ddmfs-step-2-0369-3x4-24b5ae7fb5b94b75a17ae6afb6464a9c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216757/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice any scallops over 3/4-inch thick in half so they'll cook evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_lU3deWY90zMgO3KN3CykMTyr_8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216757-savory-sea-scallops-and-angel-hair-pasta-ddmfs-step-3-0373-3x4-c78a906dc2194f99ac3b9cad939154bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216757/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir scallops, basil, and parsley into the skillet. Cook and gently stir just until scallops feel slightly firm when pressed with a finger, about 2 to 3 minutes. Scallops will become tough and chewy if overcooked.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2vtAB3k931d-R9snwIYcBeFfnm4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216757-savory-sea-scallops-and-angel-hair-pasta-ddmfs-step-4-0380-3x4-a43cd7f521f84fca9bc7262e010459d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216757/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low; stir in lemon juice and season with salt and pepper. Pour in cream if you like a thicker sauce and cook just until the sauce begins to simmer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OPGNd-v3t-j0A80UCYIa-23_b0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216757-savory-sea-scallops-and-angel-hair-pasta-ddmfs-step-6-0387-3x4-0a4b3cd6ab804eeca412acd94efeeba0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216757/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle scallops and sauce over hot pasta and sprinkle Parmesan cheese over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PuFG7qLC-Q2LQzuQ1uy_M3v07Vo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216757-savory-sea-scallops-and-angel-hair-pasta-DDMFS-4x3-6377dd8d670d4ea8b63cc6127a696e7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216757/step_06.webp"
    }
